      "exitCode": 0,
      "stdout": "Edge cases of the clap parser\n\nUsage: edge [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  flags   Flags and counters read from the environment\n  need    Requires an argument, else prints help\n  pos     A positional and a subcommand\n  multi   A multi-value positional and a subcommand\n  hid     Hidden required arguments\n  emoji   Non-BMP characters\n  strict  A required subcommand and an environment value\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\n",
      "stderr": "",
      "parsed": null
    },
